{"id":"485737","name":"莲藕排骨汤","author":"原来你也在这里！","authorId":"11316055","desc":"","cover":"images/485737/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨斩成小段儿。","img":"images/485737/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莲藕洗净。","img":"images/485737/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"莲藕去皮。","img":"images/485737/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放水烧开，把排骨放入焯烫,捞出放入砂锅中。","img":"images/485737/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"砂锅中放入葱段，姜片、白醋、料酒，放入开水。","img":"images/485737/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"莲藕切片儿。","img":"images/485737/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将切好的莲藕放入水中洗干净。","img":"images/485737/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"莲藕捞出备用。","img":"images/485737/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"排骨炖半个小时后，将莲藕放入砂锅中一起炖一个小时左右。","img":"images/485737/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"莲藕排骨汤就做好了。","img":"images/485737/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开动吧😋","img":"images/485737/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}